# skills/ is deliberately NOT ignored: apm and `npx skills` install the skills from
# what this repository has committed, so the built tree has to be present in it.
# `make mo-qc` proves skills/ byte-matches a fresh build of src/skills/ + shared/,
# which is what keeps a committed build artefact honest.
node_modules
.DS_Store

# Omnigent points a Codex harness at a throwaway CODEX_HOME inside the working
# directory, so this appears during any run that uses that route and is gone when
# the session ends. Ignored because a Phase 0 fixture run should not have to
# remember to delete it before committing.
.codex-tmp/
